    proxy           Manage the independent GOST high-speed proxy backend
    version         Show version information
    help            Show instructions
    uninstall       Remove OnionGate from system

OPTIONS (used with start):
    -o, --obfs4     Start OnionGate using obfs4 bridge
    -s, --snowflake Start OnionGate using snowflake bridge
    -m, --meek      Start OnionGate using meek_lite bridge
    --country CODE Prefer Tor exits in the specified two-letter country (for example: de)
    -v, --verbose   Show full Tor log output
    --spoof-mac     Opt in to temporary MAC address changes (may disrupt connectivity)

EXAMPLES:
    oniongate start
    oniongate start --obfs4
    oniongate start -s
    oniongate start -v
    oniongate stop
    oniongate diagnostics
    sudo oniongate diagnostics
    oniongate refresh
    sudo oniongate proxy start
    sudo oniongate proxy diagnostics

Diagnostics performs bounded sequential SOCKS downloads by default.
Use --compare-direct to send a direct baseline outside Tor. Defaults: 1 MiB
and three samples; configure with:
ONIONGATE_DIAGNOSTICS_URL (HTTPS only),
ONIONGATE_DIAGNOSTICS_BYTES (65536 through 10485760) and
ONIONGATE_DIAGNOSTICS_SAMPLES (1 through 5).

SPLIT TUNNELING:
    oniongate split status
